'''Rei Ayanami''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event|Evangelion Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] was added in [[Version 12.4 Update|Version 12.4]] which gave her a 20% chance to dodge Angel enemies and be strong against Angel enemies.

